      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch9-mcq-001",
      "text": "\\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\dfrac{2x^2 + 3x + 1}{2x^2 - 4x + 2}\\) এর মান কত?",
