      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "লব ও হরকে \\(x^2\\) দিয়ে ভাগ করে \\(\\dfrac{2+\\frac{3}{x}+\\frac{1}{x^2}}{2-\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{2}{x^2}}\\to\\dfrac{2}{2}=1\\)",
