    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch9-mcq-004",
      "text": "\\(y = \\sqrt{x + \\sqrt{x + \\sqrt{x + \\cdots}}}\\) হলে \\(\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = \\) কত?",
