      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\ln(1-3x)\\) কে \\(-3x-\\dots\\) ধরে বা \\(\\lim_{h\\to0}\\dfrac{\\ln(1+h)}{h}=1\\) এ \\(h=-3x\\) বসিয়ে\n\\(\\dfrac{\\ln(1-3x)}{3x}=-\\dfrac{\\ln(1-3x)}{-3x}\\to-1\\)",
