    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch9-mcq-008",
      "text": "যদি \\(y = \\sec x\\) হয় তবে \\(y_2 + y\\) এর মান কোনটি?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(2\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(2y\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(2y^2\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(2y^3\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(y_1=\\sec x\\tan x\\)\n\\(y_2=\\sec x\\tan^2x+\\sec^3x=\\sec x(\\sec^2x-1)+\\sec^3x=2y^3-y\\)\n\\(\\therefore y_2+y=2y^3\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 7,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch9-mcq-009",
      "text": "\\(x^y = e^{x+y}\\) হলে \\(\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = ?\\)",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{x - y}{x(1 - \\ln x)}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{x - y}{x(\\ln x - 1)}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{y - x}{x(\\ln x - 1)}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{x - y}{\\ln x - 1}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "উভয় পক্ষে \\(\\ln\\) নিয়ে \\(y\\ln x=x+y\\)।\nx-এর সাপেক্ষে অন্তরীকরণ: \\(y'\\ln x+\\dfrac{y}{x}=1+y'\\)\n\\(y'(\\ln x-1)=\\dfrac{x-y}{x}\\Rightarrow y'=\\dfrac{x-y}{x(\\ln x-1)}\\)",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 15,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
