    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch9-mcq-012",
      "text": "\\(f(1) = 6,\\ f'(1) = 3\\) হলে, \\(x = 0\\) বিন্দুতে \\(\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\{\\log f(e^x)\\}\\) এর মান কোনটি?",
